    "Final studies are redacted derivatives of exported final designs, not pixel-exact masters.",
    "Upstream images are reduced reference copies with identifying file metadata removed.",
    "Real photographs, generated concept imagery and third-party artwork are explicitly distinguished.",
    "Private original briefs, copy, names, contact details, file paths, account IDs, design links and QR payloads are omitted.",
    "Three central portraits are solid placeholders in the final study; their source photographs are not distributed."
